module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.resolved_reference_outside_execution_closure

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data resolved_reference_outside_execution_closure: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "resolved_reference_outside_execution_closure" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "resolved reference outside the execution closure (an Accepted program contains a resolved call edge whose target declaration's OWNER MODULE is absent from the module closure loaded for that execution, so resolve and typecheck both report success and the program dies at run time. ",

    "MECHANISM: bare-reference resolution consults a declaration population BROADER than the explicit-import closure from which the runtime index is built, so the two phases answer to two different denominators and nothing joins them. ",

    "THE SPECIMEN, found by execution rather than by reading, and recorded here because a class whose only evidence is an argument is not a class: three witness files -- test.claim.spark_serving_observe_witness_test, test.claim.spark_serving_model_store_witness_test and test.claim.spark.spark_cell_role_retirement_witness_test -- CALLED hermetic_fixture_provenance with no import of the module declaring it. ",

    "Resolve accepted them, typecheck accepted them, and every claim reaching the call refused at run time with `no declaration named hermetic_fixture_provenance in this execution's loaded index (searched the modules loaded for this run; the name may be declared in a module this run did not load)`. ",

    "The positive control is exact and cheap: adding the one import admits and executes the UNCHANGED call. ",

    "WHY IT IS NOT ONE OF THE ROWS BESIDE IT, checked rather than assumed. ",

    "It is not `reachability_read_as_occupancy`: nothing here mistook reachability for occupancy, and the declaration is genuinely reachable AND genuinely resolved. ",

    "It is not `identity_absent_graph_traversal`: the declaration exists, has an identity, and that identity is found -- what is absent is the RELATION from the resolved target to the modules the execution loader materializes. ",

    "This is the missing agreement between two denominators, not the occupancy of either one. ",

    "RUNG, SCOPED AND NOT INFLATED: mitigatable at the source-to-witness-execution grain the specimen demonstrates, where the runtime refusal is typed, located and loud. ",

    "THE LANGUAGE-WIDE RUNG IS NOT CLAIMED and the reason is a control that has not been run: place an observable EFFECT before the unloaded call and see whether it executes before the refusal. ",

    "If it does, the class is not mitigatable at that grain without preflight or rollback, because the failure arrives after the program has already acted. ",

    "Until that control answers, this row's rung is a statement about witness execution and nothing wider. ",

    "CEILING: structurally guaranteed rather than structurally impossible -- source can still omit an import, so the state stays writable, but no Accepted program should contain the edge. ",

    "NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, naming the CAPABILITY: acceptance joins every resolved declaration identity's owner module to the exact local/import/prelude closure used to construct the execution index. ",

    "DISCRIMINATING RED: a bare call with no explicit import is refused BEFORE Accepted, not after. ",

    "POSITIVE CONTROL: adding the exact import admits and executes the unchanged call. ",

    "REPAIR DIRECTION, and the wrong arm is the tempting one: constrain RESOLUTION and ADMISSION. ",

    "Do NOT widen the runtime loader to chase bare-reference edges -- that converts undeclared dependencies into implicit imports and dissolves the direct-import law to make a symptom go away, which is the absorbing-fallback shape applied to a language rule. ",

    "Both phases must consume ONE admitted dependency closure. ",

    "RECOGNITION RULE: a green typecheck is not evidence that a call can execute unless the phase that accepted it and the phase that will run it were answering to the same module set; when a name resolves but its module is not imported, ask which denominator each phase used before concluding the reference is sound.)",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
